      How Procurement Teams Can Lower Initial Risk
    </h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2.5 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      <li>
        <strong class="text-slate-900">Audit Stock Molds First:</strong> Selecting an existing HDPE brick mold within ±5 mm of your target footprint saves $4,000+ in tooling CAPEX and trims 4 weeks from launch timelines.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-slate-900">Negotiate Mold Amortization:</strong> Request a written rebate returning 50% to 100% of custom blow-mold fees once cumulative volume crosses 50,000–100,000 units.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-slate-900">Standardize Film Web Widths:</strong> Keep pouch width identical across 250 g, 500 g, and 1,000 g SKUs and vary only cut length so multiple sizes run off one film specification.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-slate-900">Evaluate Dry-Shipped Formats:</strong> Importing dry self-absorbing sheets or pre-dosed empty pouches eliminates ocean freight surcharges on water weight.
      </li>
